# ============================================================
# Accepted-risk suppressions — reviewed 2026-03-25
# ============================================================
#
# canvas@2 → @mapbox/node-pre-gyp@1.0.11 → tar@6.x
# -------------------------------------------------------
# All CVEs below are in @mapbox/node-pre-gyp, a BUILD-TIME tool that
# unpacks pre-built canvas binaries during `npm install`.  It is never
# called at runtime.  The only fix (canvas@3) requires a non-trivial
# migration of chartjs-node-canvas (API breaking change) and is tracked
# in a separate work item.  The actual installed `tar` is overridden to
# >=7.5.11 via npm overrides, so runtime tar is not affected.

CVE-2026-23745
CVE-2026-23950
CVE-2026-24842
CVE-2026-26960
CVE-2026-29786
CVE-2026-31802

# cross-spawn / glob / minimatch — Trivy reads declared version ranges in
# nested node_modules package.json files and resolves them to the minimum
# matching vulnerable version.  The ACTUAL installed top-level versions are
# patched via npm overrides (cross-spawn@7.0.6, glob@10.5.0, minimatch@9.0.9).
# Trivy cannot distinguish between a declaration and an installation here.

CVE-2024-21538
CVE-2025-64756
CVE-2026-26996
CVE-2026-27903
CVE-2026-27904
